ability.abilitydescription:
Under certain circumstances the players may have to check that their weaponry or armour does not break. In these cases the is compared with the Weapons Break DC using the following table.
{% include "docs/tables/weapon_and_armour_checks.xml" %}
Each item has a spirit forged into it when it is created. A weapon's spirit may not be immediately obvious to an observer, and is different from it's construction quality. Cheap weapons made by unskilled artisans tend to have a Poor weapon spirit. Weapons made by skilled artisans with great care might have a Superior weapon spirit.
